# "+1: Draw two cards. If you've committed a crime this turn, discard a card. Otherwise, discard two cards." Bot1 casts Oko with
# four Moxen and uses +1 with no crime committed: it draws a Lightning Bolt and a Grizzly Bears to the Forest and Island left in
# hand, then discards two of the four (the Island and the Grizzly Bears), and Oko's loyalty is 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Oko, the Ringleader
Forest
Island
Lightning Bolt
Grizzly Bears
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x27

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Oko, the Ringleader.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Oko, the Ringleader.Activate(Ability: Draw two cards)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Island; Grizzly Bears)
? Bot1.Hand = Forest; Lightning Bolt
? Bot1.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears; Island
? Bot1.Battlefield.Oko, the Ringleader.Counters.Loyalty = 4
